Here's a function that sorts a JSON object by its keys in ascending order:

```javascript
function sortJSONByKeys(json) {
  const keys = Object.keys(json);
  keys.sort();
  const sortedJson = {};

  for (const key of keys) {
    sortedJson[key] = json[key];
  }

  return sortedJson;
}
```

